 ('21e6e8a2-a471-5b73-8665-3ee231e9dc86', 'affbc0b4-52e4-5a17-8da3-d70fa14231f3', '2026-27', 'application', 'ED2', 'Early Decision II (binding)', '2027-01-04', 'Notification by mid-February (no exact date); deposit due March 1.', '53869956-2e35-59ce-acea-532d81f16cd6'),
