 ('7e265859-92d1-5be8-b5aa-69601baaa5de', '2023-2024', 69270, 19514, 1200, 2200, 88326, true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; The international page states financial aid is available to international students, all undergraduates are automatically evaluated for several scholarships (including full-tuition awards via scholarship competitions that need an essay), and CWRU awarded $213 million in institutional aid last year. Whether need is met in full for international students, and whether admission is need-blind, is not stated on the pages read, so intl_aid_policy is left unset.', 'e1e4a820-257d-526d-b709-bf93b2e0e940');
