 ('5a8f2d66-5e64-5432-a0fb-a69a713858ba', '2023-2024', 15854, 42378, 14224, 1496, 5556, 35250, 'none', false, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; The international page states there are no scholarships for international undergraduates at Clemson and that deferred payment is not available. Sister-State agreements give in-state tuition to citizens of some German states, Queensland (Australia) and the Province of Taiwan.', '58e71d96-f710-5d26-bd54-c6cfa87a1a3a');
