 ('TOEFL_IBT', 100, 'Expected score on the old 0-120 scale, ''not a strict cutoff''. TOEFL ITP: CEFR C1.'),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 5.5, 'Recommended on the new 1-6 scale (from 2026-01-21).'),
 ('IELTS', 7.5, 'Expected overall band, ''not a strict cutoff''.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 130, 'Most competitive applicants typically score above 130 out of 160.')) v;
