 ('e255622a-e1b6-59ed-af98-7513808cd6de', '2023-2024', 5656, 20116, 14020, 1600, 5292, 25144, 'merit_only', true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Admitted international first-years are automatically considered for FSU''s out-of-state tuition waiver scholarship; students are told of offers with their admission decision. No need-based aid for international students is described.', 'fb864f6a-944f-534d-b7c0-218f01d38e22');
