 ('ce5c7cad-f0c4-5b50-a6eb-dbb0b8446827', '2023-2024', 71338, 21202, 1200, 2752, 92563, true, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Admitted international applicants who request aid are considered for a very limited number of need-based scholarships; Georgetown''s 100%-of-need commitment covers US citizens and permanent residents. No academic or merit scholarships. CSS Profile required; aid notifications go out by the first week of April. The pages read do not say whether admission is need-blind or need-aware for international applicants.', '0be639f5-66dc-532a-b0e1-ac784aa3b5d6');
