 ('66e61bb2-7fb2-5448-8f85-48157b6f9ab4', '2023-2024', 73100, 23434, 800, 1400, 93131, 'need_aware_limited', true, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Aid goes to a small number of admitted international applicants; financial need may affect admission chances. HMC states it can meet 100% of demonstrated need for only a handful of international students. Students who enter without aid are not considered for aid later. Merit: the So International Scholarship (one recipient per entering class, offered regardless of need, no separate application); international students may also apply for some merit awards.', '9950b3ad-12b1-5486-aa29-347297a626f1');
