 ('engineering', 'C', 'College of Engineering at Idaho''s only Carnegie R1 university (per U of I); placed C as a solid regional program. Editorial judgment, not a ranking.'),
 ('business', 'D', 'Editorial judgment (v1, reviewed 2026-10-20)'),
 ('biology_life_sci', 'C', 'U of I has a College of Agricultural and Life Sciences; placed C as a solid regional program. Editorial judgment, not a ranking.'),
 ('pre_med', 'D', 'Editorial judgment (v1, reviewed 2026-10-20)'),
 ('economics', 'D', 'Editorial judgment (v1, reviewed 2026-10-20)'),
