 ('cc15eeaa-d36e-578b-9aee-3d7593f9fe34', '2025-2026', 23826, 20382, 4253, 382, 345, 22162, 19001, 1245, 1007, 45.12, 6.98, 3.63, 99.93, '{"4.0": 24.78, "3.75-3.99": 17.06, "3.50-3.74": 16.61, "3.25-3.49": 15.91, "3.00-3.24": 15.76, "2.50-2.99": 9.74, "2.0-2.49": 0.14, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025; residency split excludes 37 applicants / 29 admits of unknown residency). International: 345 of 382 admitted (90%). No waitlist; no early decision or early action. Undergrad enrollment is B1 total undergraduates (19,513); intl_undergrads is the B2 nonresident total (165). SAT composite 25/50/75 = 1000/1110/1210. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column. The university reports the middle 50% GPA of admitted fall 2026 freshmen as 3.29-4.05 (self-reported).', '442e5282-e9ed-54ba-af32-154fe683f583');
