 ('cc15eeaa-d36e-578b-9aee-3d7593f9fe34', '2026-2027', 12669, 25338, 25338, 4146, 12460, 830, 3422, false, true, 'CDS G1/G5 (first-year, 2026-27): required fees ($4,146.30) include student health insurance, automatically charged at 9+ credit hours and waivable with proof of insurance. Tuition varies by program for about 30% of undergraduates. Transportation estimate $2,452 not included in other_usd. The CDS H6 nonresident-aid section was left blank.; Undergraduate International Admissions Scholarship: automatic with admission for a cumulative GPA of 3.0+ (4.0 scale) and English proficiency; valued up to $5,000 per year and renewable (needs continuous 12+ hour enrollment and a 2.75 GPA). It cannot be combined with full-tuition scholarships or waivers. International students are generally not eligible for the same aid as Americans. Submitting SAT/ACT may open other scholarships.', '442e5282-e9ed-54ba-af32-154fe683f583');
