 ('301a78d8-1851-554b-8cea-bbdf8bb12255', '2025-2026', 24625, 21652, 6160, 3183, 2067, 5921, 5452, 15521, 14133, 12, 45, 3.76, 99.87, '{"4.0": 30.93, "3.75-3.99": 26.8, "3.50-3.74": 18.18, "3.25-3.49": 11.25, "3.00-3.24": 7.29, "2.50-2.99": 5.0, "2.0-2.49": 0.4, "1.0-1.99": 0.02}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency split (in-state 5,921 / out-of-state 15,521 / international 3,183 applicants; international admit rate computed 2,067/3,183 = 64.9%, 141 enrolled). Undergrad enrollment and intl count are the B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (26,346; nonresident 985). No early decision or early action; no waitlist; no application closing date (rolling). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column; 0.13% had a GPA below 1.0 and is omitted.', 'c6f2514d-f515-5985-858e-14dea830b637');
