 ('6782144d-72fa-5e08-9354-5af82cd895ba', '2025-2026', 31454, 25131, 5561, 1502, 637, 5892, 4984, 24060, 19510, 12, 1, 1, 22, 60, 3.86, 99.42, '{"4.0": 35.45, "3.75-3.99": 28.83, "3.50-3.74": 18.88, "3.25-3.49": 12.08, "3.00-3.24": 3.82, "2.50-2.99": 0.9, "2.0-2.49": 0.04, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency split (in-state 5,892 / out-of-state 24,060 / international 1,502 applicants; international admit rate computed 637/1,502 = 42.4%, 52 enrolled). Undergrad enrollment and intl count are the B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (23,407; nonresident 266). No early decision or early action in the CDS (the admissions site now lists an Early Action date, see cycle file). Application closing date May 1. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column. Applicants also pass through the Regent Admission Index (RAI) used by Iowa''s public universities.', 'b09748b2-5c77-54b2-b054-2e8099884a83');
