 ('4fbefaaf-e530-51da-b425-1ee363f88308', '2025-2026', 10601, 28555, 28555, 978, 11520, 1062, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'CDS G1 first-year rates (the CDS ticks ''2026-27 costs not available yet, expected 7/23/2026'', so these are treated as 2025-26 rates; the ''Nonresident'' tuition line is used for international students). H6: only institutional non-need-based aid is available to nonresidents; the CDS leaves the recipient count and dollar amounts blank.; Wildcat Nonresident Award (domestic and international, no ACT/SAT needed) discounts the nonresident part of tuition by GPA: 3.90+ 100% (about $19,101/yr), 3.75-3.89 80% (about $15,281/yr), 3.50-3.74 60% (about $11,461/yr), 3.25-3.49 50% (about $9,551/yr); renewable up to four years with a 3.0 K-State GPA. CDS H6: only institutional non-need-based aid is available to nonresidents.', '40783cf9-72ae-5b9d-944e-aa527309fd0f');
