 ('a88c321f-2c01-5ce0-9d0c-59dea94f0e2b', '2026-2027', 9090, 29160, 29160, 2382, 13950, 1128, 2388, 'merit_only', 120, 10391, false, true, 'CDS G1 first-year rates for 2026-27; the ''Non-resident (International)'' tuition line is used. H6 (final 2024-25): 120 degree-seeking nonresidents received institutional aid, averaging $10,391 ($1,246,965 total); the web edition does not show which aid types are ticked. Tuition varies by program (G4: 43% pay more than the G1 figure).; All admitted international students are automatically reviewed for Global tuition scholarships (holistic, no separate application; must meet the English requirement for unconditional admission, pay the enrollment deposit by May 1 and have all materials in by then): Global Laureate $15,000/yr (up to $60,000), Global Ambassador $10,000/yr (up to $40,000), Global Delegate $4,000/yr (up to $16,000), for up to four years with a 3.0 GPA and 24 credits per year. The need-based status of aid for nonresidents is not confirmed from the sources reviewed.', '57d8b112-5b09-593d-8409-47972899a670');
