 ('a2aec953-f2a7-5d9e-bb7b-e0a27429d1cc', '2025-2026', 28024, 20646, 5160, 1655, 305, 9828, 7231, 16541, 13110, 16.8, 63.0, 3.76, 99.63, '{"4.0": 35.5, "3.75-3.99": 22.84, "3.50-3.74": 16.44, "3.25-3.49": 10.78, "3.00-3.24": 7.72, "2.50-2.99": 5.84, "2.0-2.49": 0.78, "1.0-1.99": 0.12}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025). International (non-resident, by address at application) admit rate was only 305 of 1,655 (18%), far below the in-state 74% and out-of-state 79%, so do not assume an easy admit for international applicants who miss the 3.0 GPA + English ''assured admission'' criteria. No waitlist; no early decision or early action. Undergrad enrollment is B1 total undergraduates (23,003); intl_undergrads is the B2 nonresident total (418). SAT composite 25/50/75 = 1060/1160/1250. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column (sums to 100.02).', '46317015-3f91-5e6e-9f38-d1d5877d4e84');
