 ('a49d80ae-e1a1-54b6-bceb-1e3bd69434dc', '2025-2026', 15024, 13725, 2697, 211, 204, 11577, 10701, 3236, 2820, 7, 1, 3.43, 100, '{"4.0": 19, "3.75-3.99": 13, "3.50-3.74": 15, "3.25-3.49": 15, "3.00-3.24": 13, "2.50-2.99": 25}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class); residency split from the C1 residency table (in-state 11,577 / out-of-state 3,236 / international 211 applicants; 10,701 / 2,820 / 204 admitted; 2,494 / 167 / 36 enrolled). Undergrad enrollment and nonresident count are the B1/B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (17,504; 212 nonresidents). SAT/ACT percentiles cover only the 7% (184) / 1% (24) of enrollees who submitted scores. The CDS gives no GPA band below 2.50 (distribution sums to 100). Domestic early action closes 12/1 (notified 1/15, CDS C22); no early decision.', '6edf701e-88f3-5354-a9e6-cccfecf36c5f');
