 ('ff88d87f-2080-5255-91cf-71645b8f2cb1', '2025-2026', 37621, 36635, 5458, 439, 429, 4307, 4230, 32875, 31976, 27, 61, 3.6, 99.93, '{"4.0": 28.66, "3.75-3.99": 18.32, "3.50-3.74": 16.94, "3.25-3.49": 13.79, "3.00-3.24": 10.69, "2.50-2.99": 10.19, "2.0-2.49": 1.36, "1.0-1.99": 0.06}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class; the CDS office reports the Oxford and regional campuses together). International: 439 applied, 429 admitted. SAT scores were submitted by 27% (1,459) and ACT by 61% (3,341) of enrollees. Undergrad enrollment and nonresident count are the B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (22,939; nonresident 287). Student-to-faculty ratio 18:1 is from College Navigator. G1 (costs) was left blank in this CDS, so costs come from the admissions cost-of-attendance page.', 'f345bfd9-f350-5f6b-8856-ca196f607ddb');
