 ('441ab975-fd7e-5bfa-82f9-ae559dd5d271', '2025-2026', 14072, 13607, 1152, 2259, 2188, 2026, 1888, 9787, 9531, 22.66, 2.0, 3.29, 94, '{"4.0": 3, "3.75-3.99": 18, "3.50-3.74": 17, "3.25-3.49": 17, "3.00-3.24": 18, "2.50-2.99": 20, "2.0-2.49": 6, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1/C9/C11/C12, Penn State Harrisburg campus only, fall 2025 entering class (residency split as printed in C1). No early decision; early action closes 11/01 with notification 12/24; no application closing date. SAT/ACT optional (considered if submitted); score percentiles are for the 261 enrolled students who submitted SAT (23 submitted ACT). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11.', '766abd3b-fd24-52c9-b5d0-54dd06445ff3');
