 ('6a37a137-19e5-5455-a2ce-8901f5b5b815', '2025-2026', 13445, 9331, 999, 1303, 812, 670, 17, 8, 3.57, 99.9, '{"4.0": 8, "3.75-3.99": 26, "3.50-3.74": 28, "3.25-3.49": 22, "3.00-3.24": 13, "2.50-2.99": 2, "2.0-2.49": 1, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'Test-optional: only 17% of enrolled first-years submitted SAT and 8% ACT, so the score ranges describe a self-selected group. CDS C21 (Fall 2025 class) reports ED applicant/admit counts as ''na'' because ED starts with the fall 2026 applicant pool. Residency (in-state/international) applicant counts and class rank (C10) were not reported. Fall 2025 applicant counts cover Seaver College first-years only.', 'cf79cf95-9782-5fd9-a2e5-3c40e152fa78');
