 ('6a37a137-19e5-5455-a2ce-8901f5b5b815', '2026-2027', 74370, 832, 20490, 1000, 1500, 'merit_only', false, 145, 36013, true, false, 'CDS G1/G5/H6 (2026-2027 costs). Food and housing figure is the first-year on-campus amount (undergraduates overall: $23,260). G5 also lists $1,000 transportation. H6: only institutional non-need-based aid is available to nonresidents; the 145 recipients averaged $36,013 (non-need-based awards).; CDS H6 (2025-26): only institutional non-need-based aid is available to nonresidents (145 recipients, average $36,013). All applicants are automatically considered for the George Pepperdine Achievement Award; no separate application. Regents Scholars Program needs SAT/ACT/CLT scores.', 'cf79cf95-9782-5fd9-a2e5-3c40e152fa78');
