 ('CAMBRIDGE', 'accepted', null, 'Pass on Certificate in Advanced English (CAE) or Certificate of Proficiency in English (CPE); no numeric minimum. Cambridge IGCSE/O-Levels and AS/A Levels need a C.', 'd0c91b3a-6f53-5eba-8a13-a3302fd433fd'::uuid)) v;
