 ('e7afddbc-ddc1-5066-ad00-770337d69f80', '2024-2025', 5965, 5892, 1418, 1852, 1806, 2025, 2011, 2088, 2075, 4.2, 61.9, 3.51, 94.6, '{"4.0": 10.22, "3.75-3.99": 30.5, "3.50-3.74": 17.9, "3.25-3.49": 15.66, "3.00-3.24": 11.71, "2.50-2.99": 10.74, "2.0-2.49": 2.68, "1.0-1.99": 0.59}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency table (fall 2024 entering class): the column under INTERNATIONAL gives 1,852 applied / 1,806 admitted / 197 enrolled (enrolled matches the B1 first-time nonresident count of 197). SAT percentiles are based on only 60 enrolled students. No early decision or early action; no waitlist. Applicant counts by residency sum to the total. Check marks for C7 (factors) are not readable in the PDF text, so factors are omitted.', '942f9a38-2e95-5270-9361-566d8e7de369');
