 ('09afff14-6d28-5867-a5bd-c05e44a6a170', '2024-2025', 5976, 5665, 938, 2763, 2712, 2785, 2544, 424, 405, 1, 22, 3.3, 90, '{"4.0": 6, "3.75-3.99": 14, "3.50-3.74": 15, "3.25-3.49": 16, "3.00-3.24": 18, "2.50-2.99": 22, "2.0-2.49": 8, "1.0-1.99": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2024 entering class): international = ''Nonresidents'' row (2,763 applied, 2,712 admitted, 197 enrolled); 4 applicants had unknown residency. SAT percentiles come from only 13 enrolled students. This is the newest CDS posted (no 2025-26 file found). The CDS prints average GPA as 3.3 and percent reporting as 0.9. No early decision or early action.', 'fa3adb2f-3e0a-5821-a50b-bc5fc12f747a');
