 ('590f4f16-d3d7-53c9-b868-524dd8523a5b', '20a7084b-1e32-5025-95a5-13e731c8f72c', '2026-27', 'application', 'EA', 'Early Action', '2026-12-01', '2027-02-01', 'Non-binding. Notified by Feb 1; deposit May 1 (Mar 5 for priority housing/registration). CSS Profile and FAFSA due Dec 15.', 'fe847949-3f24-57df-876e-ec0cda5e6c6d'),
