 ('c5f81345-7505-52b2-8477-2bfb15a54fd3', '2025-2026', 64197, 30930, 3964, 8447, 5667, 42719, 17065, 13031, 8198, 10563, 5191, 3462, 38, 4, 99.95, '{"4.0": 45.43, "3.75-3.99": 24.76, "3.50-3.74": 17.59, "3.25-3.49": 7.75, "3.00-3.24": 4.32, "2.50-2.99": 0.13, "2.0-2.49": 0.03, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'No early decision (CDS C21). Early action offered (C22). CDS C12 reports the average high school GPA as 94.48 on a 100-point scale, so gpa_avg is left blank (not a 4.0-scale value). Out-of-state figures exclude international. SAT/ACT is not required (considered if submitted) except for the Scholars for Medicine / Dental Medicine honors programs.', '76fb7873-ec0d-57fd-ba77-807ccc70a6cf');
