 ('c5f81345-7505-52b2-8477-2bfb15a54fd3', '2023-2024', 10931, 34911, 18874, 900, 3248, 31654, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Not confirmed for international students: the scholarships page says all incoming first-year applicants are considered for merit scholarships (most need no separate application) and mentions the FAFSA for need-based awards, but it does not say whether international students are eligible. Admitted international students must document proof of financial support for one year to receive an I-20.', '36dc0671-3a4a-5e3c-a2b8-cde994b26af0');
