 ('ba6f6326-df17-5b28-9055-e105ba1840ee', '2025-2026', 145086, 13659, 6553, 20563, 13612, 1514, 3.94, 99.8, '{"4.0": 58.8, "3.75-3.99": 34.6, "3.50-3.74": 4.9, "3.25-3.49": 1.0, "3.00-3.24": 0.4, "2.50-2.99": 0.2, "2.0-2.49": 0.1, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'UC does not use SAT/ACT in admission and has no early decision/early action. Residency split and C9 test-score percentiles are blank in the UCLA CDS (test-blind). GPA distribution: the 4.0 row appears to include weighted GPAs at/above 4.0 (UC-calculated); treat as UC-weighted GPA.', '8701bd61-db49-55dd-9a50-49c9255f92d7');
