 ('IELTS', 6.0, '''6.0+''. Official scores sent directly to UMass Boston Undergraduate Admissions.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 105, 'Send via Duolingo by filtering for ''undergraduate'' programs and selecting University of Massachusetts Boston.')) v;
