 ('27ac595e-8dde-5e8c-8670-a6f952caa83b', '2023-2024', 75162, 20817, 650, 2006, 95048, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; USC does not offer need-based financial aid to international applicants, who must document funds for at least the first year. All international applicants who apply by the appropriate deadline are eligible for USC Merit Scholarships (no separate application, no minimum eligibility requirements; highly competitive).', 'e120b777-6b3b-5ecc-ad79-f5a76ab01de5');
