 ('cb2a3dbe-19e1-5294-93fc-de79851e7042', '2025-2026', 19465, 15229, 3885, 2034, 1227, 14021, 11319, 3410, 2683, 3.13, 98.9, '{"4.0": 1.54, "3.75-3.99": 12.26, "3.50-3.74": 14.64, "3.25-3.49": 16.31, "3.00-3.24": 16.78, "2.50-2.99": 24.2, "2.0-2.49": 13.77, "1.0-1.99": 0.5}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class); international = the ''Nonresidents'' residency row (2,034 applied, 1,227 admitted, 40 enrolled). In-state counts include students of unknown residency (CDS note). UWM did not report SAT/ACT percentiles or percent submitting (C9/C10 left blank because scores are self-reported). Undergrad enrollment 19,207 and 383 nonresident undergrads are CDS B1/B2 (fall 2025). No early decision or early action; no waitlist.', '8e38b849-bc38-5907-a7ed-5b4cb0aafada');
