 ('181f6451-d7cc-54ec-9f09-69615eb6b7fb', '2023-2024', 74265, 19055, 900, 1350, 91520, 'need_aware_full_need', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Meets the full demonstrated need of all admitted students who apply for aid at the time of application; need-aware for international applicants. International students must apply for aid with their admission application; those admitted without aid are not eligible later. No aid for international transfer applicants.', '47beea5a-1497-558c-8a0b-c05b1ff114c2');
