 ('business', 'C', 'Carson College of Business; placed C as a solid regional program. Editorial judgment, not a ranking.'),
 ('biology_life_sci', 'C', 'WSU''s data page reports $403M total R&D expenditures in FY24 (ranked 86th), with large life-science and agricultural research; placed C. Editorial judgment, not a ranking.'),
