 ('ielts', null, 'No numeric code; request the IELTS test center to send to ''Wichita State University - Office of International Education'', Admissions, 1845 Fairmount Box 122, Wichita KS 67260.', '2eb09e2d-843d-5826-accc-e2178a16affc'::uuid),
