 ('3a4758e1-f1ed-51fc-9bb9-6d18d1454424', '2025-2026', 15520, 1336, 567, 964, 256, 2193, 850, 25, 43, 18, 74.25, 'CDS C1/C2/C9/C12/C21 (Fall 2025 entering class). Residency split, GPA average and GPA distribution are blank in the CDS; C7 factor marks could not be read reliably from the text. Truly test-optional, so percentiles describe the 43% (SAT) / 18% (ACT) who submitted. ED closes Nov 15.', '051402d8-58be-5efb-a496-6391ffc8d178');
