 ('0484af38-0265-5b9f-aea4-0095a7ef5c5e', '2025-2026', 12355, 7647, 1300, 397, 310, 1700, 662, 3920, 2571, 6735, 4414, 2293, 980, 460, 3.9, 88, '{"4.0": 60, "3.75-3.99": 19, "3.50-3.74": 15, "3.25-3.49": 4, "3.00-3.24": 2, "2.50-2.99": 0, "2.0-2.49": 0, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'Test-optional: the CDS C9 SAT/ACT table (percent submitting and score percentiles) is blank in the PDF, so the SAT/ACT scores stay at the IPEDS baseline. Early action is the main plan (8,882 EA applicants, 6,151 admitted, 858 enrolled in fall 2025). Residency counts are for fall 2025.', '590ddf1a-7c6e-50ae-b697-e20c85ffa34f');
